      <div class="kpi"><span class="kpi-value">216</span><span class="kpi-label">Foundation exercises</span><span class="kpi-sub">One new task for each prerequisite skill</span></div>
      <div class="kpi"><span class="kpi-value">162</span><span class="kpi-label">Quick checks</span><span class="kpi-sub">Three versions per lesson, all with answers</span></div>
